stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> unverified
    unverified --> verified: Sanctioned and every required proof present
    unverified --> refused: Interface prohibited
    verified --> disabled: Operator disables or policy changes
    verified --> unverified: Evidence invalidated
    disabled --> unverified: Reverification requested
    refused --> refused: Selection attempted
